sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Project Host
    participant API as API Endpoint
    participant Svc as Service Layer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant User as Contributor

    Note over H,User: Atomic Credit Award Process

    H->>API: POST /contributions/:id/accept/
    API->>Svc: accept_contribution(contribution, host)

    rect rgb(255, 245, 235)
        Note over Svc,DB: TRANSACTION BEGIN
        activate Svc

        Svc->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

        Note over Svc: Step 1: Validate State
        Svc->>DB: SELECT * FROM contributions<br/>WHERE id=? FOR UPDATE
        DB-->>Svc: Contribution (locked)

        alt Contribution not pending
            Svc-->>API: ValueError: "Already processed"
            Note over API: Return 400 Bad Request
        end

        alt User not project host
            Svc-->>API: PermissionError: "Not authorized"
            Note over API: Return 403 Forbidden
        end

        Note over Svc: Step 2: Update Contribution
        Svc->>DB: UPDATE contributions<br/>SET status='accepted',<br/>decided_by_user_id=?,<br/>decided_at=NOW()<br/>WHERE id=?
        DB-->>Svc: 1 row updated

        Note over Svc: Step 3: Award Credit
        Svc->>DB: INSERT INTO credit_ledger_entry<br/>(to_user_id, project_id,<br/>contribution_id, created_by_user_id,<br/>amount, entry_type)<br/>VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, 1, 'award')

        alt Credit already exists
            DB-->>Svc: IntegrityError:<br/>unique_credit_per_contribution
            Note over Svc: Log warning<br/>Continue (credit exists, OK)
        else Credit created
            DB-->>Svc: CreditLedgerEntry created

            Note over Svc: Step 4: Calculate New Totals
            Svc->>DB: SELECT SUM(amount)<br/>FROM credit_ledger_entry<br/>WHERE to_user_id=?<br/>GROUP BY entry_type
            DB-->>Svc: {awards: 10, reversals: 0, adjustments: 0}

            Note over Svc: Calculate:<br/>total = 10 - 0 + 0 = 10<br/>xp = 10 * 100 = 1000<br/>level = floor(sqrt(1000/100)) = 3

            Note over Svc: Step 5: Update Cached Reputation
            Svc->>DB: UPDATE users<br/>SET reputation_data = jsonb_set(<br/>reputation_data,<br/>'{total_credits}', '10',<br/>'{xp}', '1000',<br/>'{level}', '3'<br/>)<br/>WHERE id=?
            DB-->>Svc: User updated
        end

        Svc->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        Note over Svc,DB: TRANSACTION COMMITTED ✓
        deactivate Svc
    end

    Note over Svc: Post-Commit Actions
    Svc->>Svc: transaction.on_commit(<br/>send_email.delay(contribution_id))

    Svc-->>API: Success<br/>{contribution, credit_entry}
    API-->>H: 200 OK<br/>"Contribution accepted"

    Note over Svc,User: Email queued (async)
    Svc->>User: Send notification email

    Note over H,User: Credit Award Complete!<br/>✓ Contribution accepted<br/>✓ Credit awarded<br/>✓ Reputation updated<br/>✓ Email queued
